        <!-- Pipeline Caption -->
        <mxCell id="caption" value="Figure 1. Architectural blueprint of Model 1 (Simple CNN baseline). Input tensors \(3 \times 224 \times 224\) pass through four convolutional stages with batch normalization, ReLU activations, and \(2 \times 2\) max-pooling downsampling. Adaptive average pooling collapses feature maps to a 256-D embedding prior to multi-layer perceptron projection." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor:#64748b;fontStyle=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
